.TH MU2EDAQ-DATAFORMAT-SENDER.PY 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-dataformat-viewer t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
mu2edaq-dataformat-sender.py \- build a Mu2e ROC packet from YAML and send it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mu2edaq\-dataformat\-sender.py
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR FILE ]
.RI [ formats_dir ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A PyQt6 window that lists every field of the selected format with an entry
box, or a drop-down for fields with a
.B values
table, assembles the packet live, and sends it.
Fields with a
.B fixed_value
are pre-filled and locked.
.PP
The buffer is
.B size_bytes
long, or two bytes past the highest
.B word
when
.B size_bytes
is absent.
A field whose word lies beyond the buffer is silently not written; in the
shipped formats this affects the trailing CRC and trailer rows.
Words are written big-endian unless
.B Little-endian words
is ticked.
Fields in
.BR fields ,
.BR packet_1 ,
.B packet_2
and
.B hit_format
sections are used.
.PP
.B Send to viewer
opens a TCP connection (5 s timeout), writes the bytes and closes, or sends
one UDP datagram (IPv4 only), to the host and port in the toolbar.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config " FILE"
Configuration file; see
.BR mu2e\-viewer.yaml (5).
Searched for in the current directory as for the viewer.
.TP
.I formats_dir
Directory of format YAML files; overrides
.BR formats_dir .
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
.SH FILES
.TP
.I formats/*.yaml
.TP
.I config/mu2e\-viewer.yaml
.B sender.host
and
.B sender.port
give the initial destination.
.SH EXIT STATUS
The Qt event loop's exit code, normally 0.
1 if PyYAML or PyQt6 cannot be imported.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
cd ~/mu2edaq\-main/mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer
\&./venv/bin/python mu2edaq\-dataformat\-sender.py
.fi
.RE
.SH BUGS
The heartbeat, data-request and debug-header definitions place several
fields in different bits from Mu2e-doc-4914 and from artdaq-core-mu2e, so
packets built from them are not what the DTC software expects; see
.IR doc/ISSUES\-PENDING.md ,
DFV-001.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.py (1),
.BR mu2e_send (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-formats.yaml (5)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
